        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CHB4, European Style 4 Inch Cabin Door Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass this 4\" British style cabin door hook features 2 pivoting points allowing it to move in and out plus move up and down. It can be used on any type of door, including cabinet doors, to lock in closed or open positions. Easy to install. Packaged complete with hook eye and all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-CHB4-size.gif?v=1704354688\" width=\"561\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CHB4 Cabin Door Hook Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer <a href=\"/products/6-inch-cabin-door-hook-deltana-chb6\"><b>6\" Door Hook</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CHB4 Cabin Door Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and hook eye.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CHB4.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CHB4 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
