                "title": "4 Inch Cabin Door Hook | Deltana CHB4",
                "description": "Deltana CHB4 Cabin Hooks.  Made of solid brass this 4 Inch British style cabin door hook features 2 pivoting points allowing it to move in and out plus move up and down. It can be used on any type of door, including cabinet doors, to lock in closed or open positions. Easy to install. Packaged complete with hook eye and all mounting hardware.\r\n",
